42</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div>.</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 12:22 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:16</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
