      "html": "<div id=\"step-461037\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"461037\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"13257\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-461037\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-13\">Justifying the Second Rule</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"461037\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <p>Now, let's derive the rule\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" display=\"true\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.577ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17.391ex\" height=\"4.676ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1370 7686.8 2067\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" transform=\"translate(506,676)\"><path data-c=\"64\" d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-686)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\"><path data-c=\"64\" d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\"></path></g><