        "title": "Differentiating an Exponential Function with a Base Other Than e",
        "position": 3,
        "dom_id": "step-12309",
        "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"2612\" id=\"step-12309\" stepid=\"12309\" steptype=\"tutorial\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n<a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-12309\" name=\"step-8\">Differentiating an Exponential Function with a Base Other Than e</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"12309\">?</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>If we replace  the base <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1.676ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -576.1 466.5 721.6\" width=\"1.083ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">e</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M39 168Q39 225 58 272T107 350T174 402T244 433T307 442H310Q355 442 388 420T421 355Q421 265 310 237Q261 224 176 223Q139 223 138 221Q138 219 132 186T125 128Q125 81 146 54T209 26T302 45T394 111Q403 121 406 121Q410 121 419 112T429 98T420 82T390 55T344 24T281 -1T205 -11Q126 -11 83 42T39 168ZM373 353Q367 405 305 405Q272 405 244 391T199 357T170 316T154 280T149 261Q149 260 169 260Q282 260 327 284T373 353Z\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-65\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-65\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> of an exponential function by any other positive number <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1.676ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -576.1 529.5 721.6\" width=\"1.23ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">a</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-61\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-61\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>, then the derivative is as follows:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"5.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.005ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1508.9 7368.5 2372\" width=\"17.114ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{ \\textrm{d} x}\\left( a^x \\right)= a^x \\ln a\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-64\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-78\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-28\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-61\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-29\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-3D\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M42 46H56Q95 46 103 60V68Q103 77 103 91T103 124T104 167T104 217T104 272T104 329Q104 366 104 407T104 482T104 542T103 586T103 603Q100 622 89 628T44 637H26V660Q26 683 28 683L38 684Q48 685 67 686T104 688Q121 689 141 690T171 693T182 694H185V379Q185 62 186 60Q190 52 198 49Q219 46 247 46H263V0H255L232 1Q209 2 183 2T145 3T107 3T57 1L34 0H26V46H42Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-6C\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M41 46H55Q94 46 102 60V68Q102 77 102 91T102 122T103 161T103 203Q103 234 103 269T102 328V351Q99 370 88 376T43 385H25V408Q25 431 27 431L37 432Q47 433 65 434T102 436Q119 437 138 438T167 441T178 442H181V402Q181 364 182 364T187 369T199 384T218 402T247 421T285 437Q305 442 336 442Q450 438 463 329Q464 322 464 190V104Q464 66 466 59T477 49Q498 46 526 46H542V0H534L510 1Q487 2 460 2T422 3Q319 3 310 0H302V46H318Q379 46 379 62Q380 64 380 200Q379 335 378 343Q372 371 358 385T334 402T308 404Q263 404 229 370Q202 343 195 315T187 232V168V108Q187 78 188 68T191 55T200 49Q221 46 249 46H265V0H257L234 1Q210 2 183 2T145 3Q42 3 33 0H25V46H41Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-6E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect height=\"60\" stroke=\"none\" width=\"1249\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<use x=\"346\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-64\" y=\"676\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-716)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-64\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"556\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(1489,0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-28\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(389,0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-61\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"748\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"1423\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-29\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"3580\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4636,0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-61\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" x=\"748\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(5837,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6C\"></use>\n<use x=\"278\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"6839\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-61\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>We just multiply the given exponential function by the natural logarithm of the base.</p>\n<p>Note that since <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 3302.7 936.9\" width=\"7.671ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\ln e =1</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M42 46H56Q95 46 103 60V68Q103 77 103 91T103 124T104 167T104 217T104 272T104 329Q104 366 104 407T104 482T104 542T103 586T103 603Q100 622 89 628T44 637H26V660Q26 683 28 683L38 684Q48 685 67 686T104 688Q121 689 141 690T171 693T182 694H185V379Q185 62 186 60Q190 52 198 49Q219 46 247 46H263V0H255L232 1Q209 2 183 2T145 3T107 3T57 1L34 0H26V46H42Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-6C\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M41 46H55Q94 46 102 60V68Q102 77 102 91T102 122T103 161T103 203Q103 234 103 269T102 328V351Q99 370 88 376T43 385H25V408Q25 431 27 431L37 432Q47 433 65 434T102 436Q119 437 138 438T167 441T178 442H181V402Q181 364 182 364T187 369T199 384T218 402T247 421T285 437Q305 442 336 442Q450 438 463 329Q464 322 464 190V104Q464 66 466 59T477 49Q498 46 526 46H542V0H534L510 1Q487 2 460 2T422 3Q319 3 310 0H302V46H318Q379 46 379 62Q380 64 380 200Q379 335 378 343Q372 371 358 385T334 402T308 404Q263 404 229 370Q202 343 195 315T187 232V168V108Q187 78 188 68T191 55T200 49Q221 46 249 46H265V0H257L234 1Q210 2 183 2T145 3Q42 3 33 0H25V46H41Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-6E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M39 168Q39 225 58 272T107 350T174 402T244 433T307 442H310Q355 442 388 420T421 355Q421 265 310 237Q261 224 176 223Q139 223 138 221Q138 219 132 186T125 128Q125 81 146 54T209 26T302 45T394 111Q403 121 406 121Q410 121 419 112T429 98T420 82T390 55T344 24T281 -1T205 -11Q126 -11 83 42T39 168ZM373 353Q367 405 305 405Q272 405 244 391T199 357T170 316T154 280T149 261Q149 260 169 260Q282 260 327 284T373 353Z\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-65\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-3D\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-31\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-6C\"></use>\n<use x=\"278\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1001\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMATHI-65\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1745\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-3D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2802\" xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-31\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>, our first formula is a particular case of this one!</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"5.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.005ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1508.9 13013.7 2372\" width=\"30.226ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{ \\textrm{d} x}\\left( e^x \\right)= e^x \\ln e = e^x \\cdot 1 = e^x\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-64\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\" id=\"E5-MJMATHI-78\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 38