        "html": "<div class=\"step\" contentid=\"13257\" id=\"step-461037\" stepid=\"461037\" steptype=\"tutorial\" style=\"display: block\">\n<div class=\"stepHeader\">\n<div class=\"stepName\">\n<a class=\"stepAnchor\" id=\"stepAnchor-461037\" name=\"step-13\">Justifying the Second Rule</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"461037\">?</div>\n</div>\n<p>Now, let's derive the rule\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" display=\"true\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg focusable=\"false\" height=\"4.676ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.577ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1370 7686.8 2067\" width=\"17.391ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" transform=\"translate(506,676)\"><path d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\" data-c=\"64\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-686)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\"><path d=\"M376 495Q376 511 376 535T377 568Q377 613 367 624T316 637H298V660Q298 683 300 683L310 684Q320 685 339 686T376 688Q393 689 413 690T443 693T454 694H457V390Q457 84 458 81Q461 61 472 55T517 46H535V0Q533 0 459 -5T380 -11H373V44L365 37Q307 -11 235 -11Q158 -11 96 50T34 215Q34 315 97 378T244 442Q319 442 376 393V495ZM373 342Q328 405 260 405Q211 405 173 369Q146 341 139 305T131 211Q131 155 138 120T173 59Q203 26 251 26Q322 26 373 103V342Z\" data-c=\"64\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"><path d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 28